{"version":1,"key":"card:765","content":{"id":765,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在表单中限制用户只能输入数字，一种常见做法是监听 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件，检测到非法字符后再把值覆盖回去。但这会产生一个体验问题：非法字符会短暂出现在输入框中再消失。如果能在值写入 DOM 之前就拦截掉非法输入，体验会更干净。","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件正是在这个时机触发的，它和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件分别对应输入流程中「修改前」和「修改后」两个阶段。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4ba1ebc1-bb36-4c9e-b804-4f0256c9102e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件在 DOM 元素的值即将被修改时触发，它是一个可以取消的事件，也就是说，可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"preventDefault()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来拦截用户的输入，可以执行校验，数据清洗，数据同步。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"923e73af-1697-4fb9-aa41-78bad81eafd7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件触发时，DOM 已经发生了修改，因此该事件是不可以取消的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"587ee0d3-0cd2-4ca3-9467-f7f8f23416cb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"一个输入事件的完整顺序如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"841ae2d5-a451-41bc-842f-dcb964be5171","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"keydown → beforeinput → (DOM 更新) → input → keyup","collabId":"673db7d5-aa18-449b-9014-3d9181921109","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"3ce24ea5-952b-494a-86d2-f6f3d1776201","language":"Plain","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"93921661-f260-414b-a4cc-4cc785fbcffc"},{"children":[{"text":"它们的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"event","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"InputEvent","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 接口，有如下公共属性","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5535023a-85ad-4d2c-b781-ff5518ad2f0b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"inputType","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：输入操作的类型，如 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"insertText","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"deleteContentBackward","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"insertFromPaste","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"139bf50f-f0ed-430c-b495-3b896c45cf62","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"abb70196-5ff0-4325-bfc6-225299859785","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"data","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：即将插入的文本","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"28cd7d6d-63e9-4444-a95b-122cc8952b00","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"22f1b56e-aec4-47a2-98e5-da2ec7154474","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"dataTransfer","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：粘贴和拖放时的数据","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7ad17f21-c457-46af-a627-0b602764e733","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c219f6d7-a309-4071-9800-da5f29cfcd2a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"isComposing","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：是否在 IME 组合输入中","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d99f28c8-f488-4484-8598-f6080cbeda88","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0eb461ec-8e17-45d0-a4b8-1869a9785483","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"targetRanges","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：受影响的文本范围（仅对 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件有效，因为此时 DOM 还未被修改，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"ranges","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 指向的节点和偏移量仍旧有效，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件触发时，DOM 已经被修改，原来 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"ranges","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 所指向的位置可能不存在了，返回没有意义，因此得到的是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[]","type":"formatted"},{"text":"）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7595f294-870a-4608-b796-dc926ef2b088","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2e71d370-ef31-425f-b567-59784d199d1f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"79f48bc8-c635-4070-920b-c808ce20e9aa","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"其中 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"targetRanges","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和可取消特性的组合，使得 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 在富文本编辑领域尤为重要。Slate.js、ProseMirror 等框架都重度依赖这个事件，它们在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中阻止浏览器的默认行为，然后根据 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inputType","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"targetRanges","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来维护自己的数据模型","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4a5ee0bd-e99f-4a39-9129-ffe6a7593df4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"editor.addEventListener('beforeinput', (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault(); // 阻止浏览器默认行为\n  \n  const ranges = e.getTargetRanges();\n  \n  switch (e.inputType) {\n    case 'insertText':\n      // 自定义文本插入逻辑（维护自己的数据模型）\n      customInsertText(ranges, e.data);\n      break;\n    case 'deleteContentBackward':\n      // 自定义删除逻辑\n      customDelete(ranges, 'backward');\n      break;\n    case 'insertParagraph':\n      // 自定义换行（可能需要分割节点）\n      customSplitBlock(ranges);\n      break;\n    case 'formatBold':\n      // 自定义加粗\n      customToggleMark('bold');\n      break;\n  }\n});","collabId":"fe0b5a9e-ae26-4c6a-82dd-1dfe6baffcb2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2a4a2413-4ece-40b9-8720-4b7221d8e303","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"183991a2-741a-41f3-be84-5bb19e9f31f8"},{"children":[{"text":"在表单场景同样如此，比如用户从外部粘贴内容时，可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"beforeinput","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 拦截粘贴数据并进行清洗，又或者限制输入长度","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4949fe4b-342e-453d-887f-57f64fe61176","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 清洗粘贴内容：去除 HTML 标签，只保留纯文本\ninput.addEventListener('beforeinput', (e) => {\n  if (e.inputType === 'insertFromPaste') {\n    const raw = e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain');\n    const cleaned = raw.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\n    e.preventDefault();\n    document.execCommand('insertText', false, cleaned);\n  }\n});","collabId":"8d0dee58-f596-4c18-8b23-4dfb55cc0bac","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"03ab88c5-cd7d-414a-a523-d1de966651f8","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6903c58b-6933-4d29-860a-430fed070b88"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const MAX_LENGTH = 140;\n\ntextarea.addEventListener('beforeinput', (e) => {\n  if (e.inputType === 'insertText' || e.inputType === 'insertFromPaste') {\n    const current = textarea.value.length;\n    const incoming = (e.data || '').length;\n    if (current + incoming > MAX_LENGTH) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      showToast('已达到字数上限');\n    }\n  }\n});","collabId":"60877aa8-d65c-44a4-80e0-6dc6779ec5eb","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"cb438a66-2000-4f3c-8e16-21460c0da3e5","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"293101ea-6c8c-44fe-b25c-2eacbfc60c50"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"input","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 事件用于做变化后的响应，比如搜索场景，在用户输入完成后进行搜索","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3e96c1a1-f914-4518-ab56-af0f81031e62","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// input 事件更适合做「变化后」的响应\nsearchInput.addEventListener('input', debounce((e) => {\n  const query = e.target.value;\n  if (query.length >= 2) {\n    fetchSuggestions(query).then(renderDropdown);\n  } else {\n    hideDropdown();\n  }\n}, 300));","collabId":"66eb6ed3-7555-47e6-b89f-d37d86748b8d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"38583f24-5ab7-4456-a9c5-d979da2a4d2e","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b4058021-0f90-44fa-9904-553c4af1ce9e"}],"tags":["DOM","概念对比","input","beforeinput"],"createTime":1782297395164,"updateTime":1793532639342,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532639342}}